        <dc:title>Challenges regarding implementation of electronic chain traceability</dc:title>
        <dcterms:abstract>Purpose – Increased focus on safe and healthy food has resulted in the need for implementing electronic chain traceability. This poses challenges both regarding technical solutions and business processes. The purpose of this paper is to report from a research project where implementation in a value chain for farmed salmon is used to investigate these challenges.</dcterms:abstract>
